<title>SWITZERLAND: FIGURE SKATING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP MEDALS.</title>
<headline>FIGURE SKATING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP MEDALS.</headline>
<dateline>LAUSANNE, Switzerland 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Tara Lipinski won the gold medal in the women's event at the world figure skating championships on Saturday.</p>
<p>Compatriot Michelle Kwan took the silver and Vanessa Gusmeroli of France the bronze.</p>
</text>
